# XSH posix_typed_mem_get_info
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
# posix_typed_mem_get_info() returns an error number. The page defines ENODEV
# for a descriptor of a non-typed object and also says the behaviour is
# undefined then; ENODEV is therefore not tested. Only EBADF is.

assertion  XSH.posix_typed_mem_get_info.001
anchor     functions/posix_typed_mem_get_info.html#ERRORS/EBADF
class      conditional
when       TYM
since      2001
says       posix_typed_mem_get_info() with descriptor -1 and with a closed descriptor
           returns EBADF (as the return value).
test       t/001-ebadf.c
